<v John / Doran>I try to cast sleep on him.

01:32:18.815 --> 01:32:19.135
<v Tim / GM>Yeah. Go

01:32:19.135 --> 01:32:20.815
<v Thomas / Guy>ahead. Dorian falls asleep.

01:32:23.615 --> 01:32:33.380
<v John / Doran>Okay. 20 foot radius targeting creature with lowest HP. So I'm gonna try to place it as best I can. Sure. On him and I get to roll some dice.

01:32:35.220 --> 01:32:35.780
25.

01:32:36.915 --> 01:32:48.755
<v Tim / GM>You see him kind of like smirk to himself a little bit and then his eyes get real heavy and he takes one little step forward and then you see his eyes roll back into his head and he starts to lean backwards.

01:32:48.960 --> 01:32:53.040
<v John / Doran>I run forward and just try to cradle him down to the ground.

01:32:53.840 --> 01:33:17.050
<v Tim / GM>The door that Tick was closing didn't shut quite all the way. The door flies open and heavy hands reach to catch Tick and then he stands up, a bald head, jagged metal plates over his knuckles. Built like an ox, he looks at your group and says, To what do I have the pleasure?

01:33:18.010 --> 01:33:19.370
<v John / Doran>Diver, I take it.

01:33:20.010 --> 01:33:24.810
<v Tim / GM>Aim for flesh. He, guides Tick to the ground.

01:33:25.210 --> 01:33:30.410
<v John / Doran>Well, we came and we had some things we wanted to discuss with you. Mind if we step in?

01:33:31.025 --> 01:33:33.345
<v Tim / GM>Everybody make a perception check.

01:33:34.625 --> 01:33:35.585
<v Maggie / Poppy>22.

01:33:36.865 --> 01:33:38.865
<v John / Doran>16. Okay. 11.

01:33:39.505 --> 01:33:41.505
<v Hannah / Eryn>16. Okay. It's 12.

01:33:42.225 --> 01:34:01.080
<v Tim / GM>So I think even the 11 is capable of seeing what's happening here. Oh, I did it. As Diver lowers Tick to the ground, when he stands back up, he very cleverly tries to palm the flashbang out of Tick's hands. With a natural one, he sets it off. Oh, no.

01:34:12.215 --> 01:34:16.010
<v Hannah / Eryn>Thanks for listening to Cloud fall. I'm Hannah playing Aaron.

